            "review_text": "ゆうゆ\nNagoya, Japan3673 contributions\n0\nCrab tempura is delicious\nJul 2026 • Solo\nI was considering this restaurant when a Japanese couple I met by chance went there the day before and praised it, so I took a grab of it. It was between lunch and dinner, so I was free. I heard that getting salt and eating it with lemon juice was the local style and I imitated it. The price is a bit high, but the tempura in the soft shell club is the signature dish! It was very good. The shop staff was very kind to me, taking pictures of me.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Japanese\nShow original\nWritten August 2, 2026",
