            "review_text": "あそうたいち\nChiba, Japan4214 contributions\n0\nThis is the real shop, be careful not to go to the shop next door! The taste is different.\nMay 2024 • Friends\nThere is a similar restaurant next door, but the quality of the Ca Mau crabs they use and the dishes are completely different. Be careful, as guidebooks for Japanese tourists seem to be written by people with no taste. I recommend the crab soup that comes with crab fried rice, deep fried spring rolls and bun cha.\nForeigners can ask to sit on the second floor where it is air-conditioned. Even if you eat to your heart's content, it's super cheap at less than 2,000 yen per person, and it has a good reputation among locals.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten May 3, 2024",
