            "review_text": "fiestychef\nBrooklyn, New York125 contributions\n0\nAmazing crab vermicelli soup and good service\nDec 2018 • Couples\nwe came here around 9 (they close at 10) and ordered the spring rolls which also have crab in them (super crispy yet delicate; decent sized- we couldn't finish them between the two of us); soft shell crab in a light batter - crispy/crunchy and fresh; the crab vermicelli soup was our favorite - great crab flavor; noodles weren't overcooked and had a hint of white pepper. we also ordered a crab fried rice, it was tasty but we couldn't finish it between the two of us. service is fast. definitely come and try the crab vermicelli soup!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten December 24, 2018",
