            "review_text": "Bobby C\n6 contributions\n0\nFor Crab Lovers\nMar 2018 • Friends\nCrab Crab Crab!!!!!\n\nThis place is a must try. Their crab spring rolls and stir fried vermicelli are the dishes for me. The tamarind crab claws and crab soup was very nice as well. The only complaint and it’s a small one for me is that there are some shells left in the vermicelli dish so if you have kids, please beware. \n\nI wasn’t really a fan of the deep fried soft shell crab. I think I didn’t like the tempura batter they used. \n\nIt’s simple here and the prices are reasonable. Air conditioned rooms are upstairs. \n\nOh, make sure you go to the right one. See my photo of their sign and compare. I’ve been told because of their success, a fake store opened next to them. So another reference point is if you are looking at the shops, it’s the one on your left.\nRead more\nWritten March 16, 2018",
